;;;;;; Martini lipid topology for di-C20:1 EE (DGEE), generated using:
; The Martini lipid itp generator version M3.l01  Args are: -alname DGEE -alhead 'E P' -allink 'E E' -altail 'cCDCC cCDCC'
; WARNING: Autogenerated and not all lipid headgroup and tail combinations have been tested;
;          used with care and see K.B. Pedersen et al. 2024 for guidance.
;
; Description:
;   A general model ether lipid phosphatidylethanolamine (EE) lipid corresponding to atomistic C20:1(11c) di-gondoic acid tails.
; Parameterization:
;   This topology follows the standard Martini 3.0 lipid definitions and building block rules. 
;   Bonded parameters and mapping have been optimized as described in K.B. Pedersen et al. 2024.
; Reference(s): 
; K.B. Pedersen et al., The Martini 3 Lipidome: Expanded and Refined Parameters Improve Lipid Phase Behavior*, 
; ACS Central Science, 2025. doi: 10.1021/acscentsci.5c00755
; P.C.T. Souza et al., Martini 3: A General Purpose Force Field for Coarse-Grained Molecular Dynamics*, 
; Nature Methods, 2021. doi: 10.1038/s41592-021-01098-3
; Created: 2024.07.12
;
; Molecular topology and mapping of indices:
; NH3-PO4-ET1-C1A-C2A-D3A-C4A-C5A
;          |
;         ET2-C1B-C2B-D3B-C4B-C5B
;
;  1 - 2 - 3 - 5 - 6 - 7 - 8 - 9 
;          |
;          4 - 10- 11- 12- 13- 14
;
;@INSANE alhead=E P, allink=E E, altail=CCDCC CCDCC, alname=DGEE, charge=0.0
;@RESNTEST DGE==DGEE if: atoms[0]==NH3
;@BEADS NH3 PO4 ET1 ET2 C1A C2A D3A C4A C5A C1B C2B D3B C4B C5B 
;@BONDS NH3-PO4 PO4-ET1 PO4-ET2 ET1-ET2 ET1-C1A C1A-C2A C2A-D3A D3A-C4A C4A-C5A ET2-C1B C1B-C2B C2B-D3B D3B-C4B C4B-C5B 
;

